title: Payers › Process › Reach and Caller instructions
route: /payers/summit?tab=process
intro: The closed section under the workflow, 'How to reach Summit and what Caller says'. Opened, it shows 'How to reach' (read only here; its three lines are edited from the header's 'Edit' button) and 'Instructions for Caller' (the script every Phone step follows, with its own 'Edit').
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Scroll below the workflow card\non the Process tab"
click op "Click the closed section\n'How to reach Summit and what Caller says'\nIt is a button; Enter or Space also open it"
process opn "Section opens\nClick again to close it\nIt starts closed every time the tab opens"
screen rc "'How to reach Summit'\nThree rows: Portal, Phone, Fax"
process rows "Each row has an icon, a title and a line\nPortal: Provider portal, sign-in saved by Navigator\nPhone: Provider line, weekdays 8 am to 6 pm\nFax: Not used"
toast ro "No edit button on this part\nChange the lines with 'Edit' in the header"
screen cc "'Instructions for Caller'\nThe script in a tinted box\n'Used by the Phone steps. Saved 10/12.'"
process script "Script: ask for the provider line, give member ID and date of birth,\nask if the request arrived, never agree to a change,\nlog the call"
click ce "Click 'Edit'\non the Caller card"
overlay m "Edit the instructions for Caller\nCaller follows this on every Phone step and never agrees to a change."
input i1 "Type in 'Script'\nThe box starts with the saved script"
input i2 "Type 'Reason for the edit' (required)"
click cs "Click 'Save and log the edit'"
decision d1 "Is the reason empty?"
toast er "Add a reason. It goes in the edit log."
decision d2 "Is the script the same as the saved one?"
toast t0 "'Nothing changed'"
process gap "Demo gap: a blank script is accepted\nPhone steps would then have no instructions"
store st "Script saved\n'Saved' date becomes today"
store lg "Edit log entry\nArea 'Caller instructions'\n'Instructions for Caller', before and after"
store nt "Bell notification\n'Summit caller instructions edited'\nopens the payer's Process tab"
toast t1 "'Instructions for Caller saved'\nCaller follows them on its next call.\nThe edit is logged."
process nb "No 'edit applies to new drafts only' banner\nThe script is used on the next call, not by drafts"
end e1 "Card shows the new script"
click cx "Click 'Cancel'"
click cesc "Press Escape, click the X\nor click the dimmed area"
endx x1 "Modal closes\nNothing saved, typed text discarded\nReopening starts from the saved script"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Edit payer details"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Edit log"

s1 --> op --> opn --> rc --> rows --> ro
ro -.-> g1
opn --> cc --> script --> ce --> m --> i1 --> i2 --> cs --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| er --> i2
d1 -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| t0 --> x1
d2 -->|No| st --> lg --> nt --> t1 --> nb --> e1
i1 -.-> gap
lg -.-> g2
m --> cx --> x1
m --> cesc --> x1
